### 6.7 Phase 5 Persona Refinement

❌ **BAD — no verification, no opportunity:**
```
CFO (Tier 4): "Three-year TCO?"
Architect: "Cost-effective. Mid-range."     Verdict: KEEP.
```

✅ **GOOD — evidence-bound, verified, opportunity logged:**
```
CFO (Tier 4): "Three-year TCO incl. Flex credits, Agentforce conversations, Data Cloud rows — break-even month?"
Architect (v1): "$X/yr Y1, $Y/yr steady-state; break-even month 14 from 30% call deflection."
Verification: catalog §9 confirms cost model; Agentforce conversation pricing contract-dependent → Confidence MEDIUM; ⚠️ ASSUMPTION on Y1 volume.
Verdict: ⚠️ IMPROVE — add consumption-aware design (async batching + topic guardrails). Logged as OPP-CFO-T4-1; phase_4_reentry: 4C (cost-control KPI added).
```

**Why**: Real number, real cross-ref, real confidence, logged opportunity that traces to catalog and triggers Phase 4C delta. This is the pattern Phase 5 enforces on every persona × tier.

