## 11. QUALITY CHECKLIST (RUN BEFORE EACH CHECKPOINT)

**Universal:**
- [ ] `<thinking>` block produced; RGV counts match; cross-phase contradictions checked
- [ ] Every recommendation cited with a customer fact OR marked `⚠️ ASSUMPTION`
- [ ] Preview/beta marked `⚠️ PREVIEW` with date; alternatives presented (especially Phase 3)
- [ ] Narrative in "you" terms (HLD); output sized for audience (HLD high-level / Supporting deep / Refinement Log auditable)
- [ ] Phase 2 Live Research complete with `research_log.md` (URLs + dates); every capability traces to a research_log entry
- [ ] **Verbosity (Critical Rule #15 — v1.7.0 example-anchored reform):** Per-section structural budgets met (§1 ≤80w, §2 ≤120w, §3 ≤25w/quote ×6, §4 table-only, §5 = 5 bullets ≤25w, §6 = 3-bullet ≤30w each)? No marketing-prose phrases (`clock`, `racing`, `converged`, `reshaping`, `compound`, `transformation`-without-KPI — `02_Mandatory_Stop_Points.mdc` Forbidden Phrases)? Refinement Log ≤ 500 lines (10 personas) — that frame-locked cap is retained? **Line count soft signal:** HLD length resembles `examples/retail-personalized-offerings_HLD.md` (~190 lines) for similar complexity? If HLD >380 lines (2× example), inspect — but pass on structural budgets alone if those are met.
- [ ] **Brand Palette (Critical Rule #15):** every Mermaid architecture diagram has the `classDef` block from §7 + every node assigned to a class via `class A,B,C agentforce` syntax?

**Phase 4A Feasibility:**
- [ ] Every finalist capability scored on all 8 dimensions (no "skipped because not mentioned")?
- [ ] Every cell has a citation (research_log entry, customer fact, capability catalog row, or `⚠️ ASSUMPTION`)?
- [ ] Every NO-GO capability has a proposed alternative or explicit descope agreement?
- [ ] Every CONDITIONAL has a validation path logged in Assumption Log?

**Phase 4B Coverage:**
- [ ] Bidirectional matrix built (pain → component AND component → pain)?
- [ ] Coverage = M/M (every Phase 1 pain has ≥1 addressing component)?
- [ ] Future-enabler ratio ≤ 20% (project standard cap)?
- [ ] Every future-enabler has explicit next-horizon rationale?
- [ ] No solution-without-problem components (or explicit justification)?

**Phase 4C KPIs:**
- [ ] 3-tier KPI table populated (Business / Operational / Technical)?
- [ ] Every KPI has Baseline + Target + Window + Owner?
- [ ] Every KPI has instrumentation tool named (no hand-waving)?
- [ ] Targets traced to customer ambition (not invented)?
- [ ] Pre-launch baseline capture list compiled for `KPI_Baselines_v1.md`?

**Phase 5 Persona Refinement:**
- [ ] All scheduled personas engaged (Phase-0 panel + industry overlay if applicable + 5 generic)?
- [ ] 5 tiers per persona, no skipping; every IMPROVE has full Opportunity Schema; every DISCARD has deferral target?
- [ ] Phase 4 delta re-validation triggered if components/capabilities/KPIs changed; v2 diff reconciles to v1?
- [ ] Termination trigger captured (Normal / Max-rounds / `lock now` with rationale)?

**Phase 6 HLD / Phase 7 Supporting Doc (combined):**
- [ ] HLD §6.5 Coverage from Phase 4B+5; HLD §11 KPIs from Phase 4C+5 (3-tier with baselines+targets)?
- [ ] Supporting §3.5 Feasibility (every 4A+5 entry with mitigations); §4.5 NFR (8 rows); §10 Measurement (1/KPI)?
- [ ] Supporting Appendix A Coverage Full (100% of 4B+5 entries); Appendix B Refinement Summary cross-refs Refinement Log?
- [ ] `KPI_Baselines_v1.md` exists for any TBD-baseline KPI?

