## 17–19. PHASE 5 ADVERSARIAL PERSONA REFINEMENT (Summary + Cross-Reference)

> **Authoritative spec** (full library, prompt templates, schema, decision tree, RGV, termination, Phase 4 delta rules): **`lib/docs/phase-5-persona-refinement-spec.md`**. Read before Phase 5.

### §17 — Persona Library

**Generic adversarial (always engaged, in order):**
| Persona | Focus | Signature Concern |
|---------|-------|-------------------|
| **CFO** | TCO / ROI / payback | "Cost over 3 years and break-even month?" |
| **CISO** | Security / data exposure | "Where is data and who reads it?" |
| **Skeptic-Architect** | Buy-vs-build / lock-in | "Why MuleSoft+Agentforce vs. open-source?" |
| **Vendor-Burned-Buyer** | Trust / past failures | "What stops this from being shelfware?" |
| **Compliance-Officer** | Audit / retention / residency | "Show me the audit trail and erasure flow." |

**Industry overlays** (auto-activated by `industryVertical`): Healthcare→CMIO | FinServ→CRO | Retail→VP Merchandising | Manufacturing→Plant Ops Director | Public Sector→Procurement/FedRAMP Officer. Spec §2.2.

**Phase-0 panel** engaged FIRST in panel order; if Phase-0 captured name AND pain, Tier 1 MUST reference at least one.

### §18 — 5-Tier Question Taxonomy

| Tier | Definition | Example |
|------|------------|---------|
| 1 — Basic | Confirms understanding | "What does {component} do for us?" |
| 2 — Intermediate | Probes a design choice | "Why {capability A} over {B}?" |
| 3 — Advanced | Cross-cutting behavior | "What happens when {dep degrades}?" |
| 4 — Expert | NFR / failure mode / scale | "At 10× volume, bottleneck and cost curve?" |
| 5 — Adversarial | Worst-case / counter-narrative | "Strongest panel objection we don't address?" |

> No tier skipped. Tier 5 MUST find a real gap or be marked `no-gap-found` with confidence.

### §19 — Improvement Decision Matrix (Standard S7)

| Verdict | When |
|---------|------|
| ✅ **KEEP** | best-in-class; Confidence HIGH; no superior alternative |
| ⚠️ **IMPROVE** | Confidence ≥ MEDIUM AND (blocks 4B pain OR violates NFR default OR tightens 4C KPI) |
| ❌ **DISCARD-WITH-NOTE** | Confidence LOW OR scope-creep OR cost > envelope → Risk Register / Roadmap H3 / Out-of-scope |

